# CLI deploys (`vercel deploy`) are NOT supported: rust-audiobook/site is no longer
# tracked, and the buildCommand's inputs (chapters/, audio/, book.yaml) are excluded
# below, so a CLI deploy fails fast rather than uploading 90 MB of mp3.
# Deploy from Git — Git deploys clone the whole repo and ignore this file.
.agents/
.claude/
.env
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
rust-audiobook/.cache/
rust-audiobook/chapters/
rust-audiobook/audio/
rust-audiobook/outline.md
rust-audiobook/book.yaml
